# eval/dataset/
#
# This directory holds the manually-annotated test corpus for §12 evaluation.
# Populated in Stage 7.
#
# Expected contents (created during Stage 7):
#   screenshots/          — PNG screenshots of the mock portal and ISRO portals
#   dom-snapshots/        — JSON DOM snapshots captured alongside each screenshot
#   ground-truth.jsonl    — one JSON object per line, one entry per screenshot:
#                           { "step_id", "url", "sensitive_spans": [...], "screenshot_ref" }
#
# Annotation format for sensitive_spans:
# {
#   "nodeId":  "#profile-email",
#   "label":   "email",
#   "match":   "test.analyst@example.invalid",
#   "bbox":    { "x": 120, "y": 340, "width": 240, "height": 18 }
# }
#
# Minimum dataset size for Stage 7: 50 annotated screenshots/DOM snapshots.
# See PRD §12.2 for the IoU ≥ 0.5 hit criterion.
